# Subagent Loaded Context

Before task-specific work, every subagent must resolve its active subagent
identity, rules, and skills, then send a short user-visible announcement.

Use this format:

```text
Loaded: subagent = <subagent name>; rules = <comma-separated rule filenames or (none)>; skills = <comma-separated skill names or (none)>
```

Report rules already present in the agent context; do not re-read rule files
solely to build this announcement. Include skills the subagent actually read or
is about to rely on for the task.

If the expected subagent, rule, or skill is missing or mismatched, say so plainly
in the same update before continuing or asking for a decision.
